# Minesweeper: revealing, flagging, opening a mine and clearing the field.
expect Clear the field · 0 of 105 solved
tap Minesweeper
tap Small field
wait-for-id game-more
expect Starter · Small field
expect 0 of 3 flagged
expect Flag mines
tap Rules
expect Reveal every safe square
tap Difficulty
clean
shot mines-difficulty
tap Play
wait-for-id game-more
# The first reveal is always safe.
tap-id mine-0
expect Safe. Keep going.
# Flag mode marks a square, and a second tap takes the flag off.
tap-id mine-mode
expect Flag mode. Tap a hidden square to mark it.
expect Reveal squares
tap-id mine-5
expect 1 of 3 flagged
tap-id mine-5
expect 0 of 3 flagged
tap-id mine-5
expect 1 of 3 flagged
clean
shot mines-flagged
# A flagged square is not opened by a reveal tap.
tap-id mine-mode
expect Reveal mode. Tap a hidden square to open it.
tap-id mine-5
expect 1 of 3 flagged
expect-missing Mine opened
tap-id mine-mode
tap-id mine-5
tap-id mine-mode
# Opening a mine ends the round until Undo or Restart.
tap-id mine-10
expect Mine opened. Undo the last move or restart.
expect Restart
clean
shot mines-lost
tap-id mine-1
expect Mine opened.
tap-id game-undo
expect Move undone.
expect Flag mines
tap-id mine-1
tap-id mine-2
tap-id mine-3
tap-id mine-4
tap-id mine-6
tap-id mine-7
tap-id mine-8
tap-id mine-9
tap-id mine-11
tap-id mine-12
tap-id mine-13
tap-id mine-14
expect Field cleared.
expect 3 of 3 flagged
expect Next puzzle
clean
shot mines-cleared
tap-id game-more
tap Puzzles
expect 1 of
expect Solved
tap-id 4294967295
expect Clear the field · 1 of 105 solved
# Restart puzzle in More asks first, and Keep playing leaves the field as it was.
tap Minesweeper
tap Small field
wait-for-id game-more
tap-id game-more
tap Restart puzzle
expect Clear this puzzle?
tap Keep playing
expect Field cleared.
expect-missing Solved.
tap-id game-more
tap Restart puzzle
tap-id confirm-restart
expect Starter · Small field
expect 0 of 3 flagged
tap-id game-undo
expect Field cleared.
expect-missing Solved.
